# This website currently uses no environment variables and has no backend:
# the enquiry form opens WhatsApp or the visitor's email app instead of
# sending anything to a server.
#
# If a backend is added later, list its variable NAMES here only.
# Copy this file to .env for local values and set the same names in the
# host's environment settings. Never commit .env. See SECURITY.md.
#
# Public values (safe to appear in the browser) start with VITE_.
# Secret values are for the server only: never start them with VITE_
# and never paste them into code.
